WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
[Light rhythmic music]

00:02.550 --> 00:03.350
Say it.

00:04.200 --> 00:07.867
I would like to see the figures
for the second quarter.

00:09.700 --> 00:10.950
Make it happen.

00:13.400 --> 00:15.467
Your voice. On your device.

00:21.200 --> 00:23.993
Everyone deserves to share in this success.

00:32.000 --> 00:33.100
Keep your flow.
